Like I said: If you drop things on the FIRST SQUARE INSIDE THE SHOP -
that square belongs to YOU, not the shopkeeper. Anything you drop on
that square will remain YOUR property, even if you leave the shop. The
shopkeeper will not even "seem uninterested" - you are not dropping
things in the actual floor that belongs to his shop.

When you are standing on the "door" space of a shop, it requires TWO
moves to reach a square that the shopkeeper is considered to own.

